  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Shortcut to <a href=\"DataBufferUtils.html#release(org.springframework.core.io.buffer.DataBuffer)\"><code>release</code></a> all data buffers and\nthen <a href=\"#clear()\"><code>clear()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "跳转到释放所有数据缓冲区的<a href=\"DataBufferUtils.html#release(org.springframework.core.io.buffer.DataBuffer)\"><code>release</code></a>，然后执行<a href=\"#clear()\"><code>clear()</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Adding elements increases the byte count and if the limit is exceeded,\n<a href=\"DataBufferLimitException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DataBufferLimitException</code></a> is raised.  <a href=\"#clear()\"><code>clear()</code></a> resets the\ncount. Remove and set are not supported.",
      "translation": "添加元素会增加字节计数，如果超出限制，将抛出<a href=\"DataBufferLimitException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DataBufferLimitException</code></a>。<a href=\"#clear()\"><code>clear()</code></a>会重置计数。不支持移除和设置操作。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> This class does not automatically release the\nbuffers it contains. It is usually preferable to use hooks such as\n<code>Flux.doOnDiscard(Class, Consumer)</code> that also take care of cancel and error signals,\nor otherwise <a href=\"#releaseAndClear()\"><code>releaseAndClear()</code></a> can be used.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 该类不会自动释放其包含的缓冲区。通常更优选使用诸如<code>Flux.doOnDiscard(Class, Consumer)</code>之类的钩子，这些钩子也能处理取消和错误信号，或者否则可以使用<a href=\"#releaseAndClear()\"><code>releaseAndClear()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
